    <td background="images/bg.gif"><font class=""><a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20">Tours</a></font><br><font class="testo_notizia" color="#000000"><b>An Exclusive Chance to See Madonna in Lisbon.</b></font></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="1">
    <td  background="images/riga.gif"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext">Dear Friends, <BR><BR>I have good news and bad news. I'll begin with the bad one. <STRONG>Madonna's Re-Invention tour is almost done!!!!</STRONG> Just 1 more date and no more <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> on stage for a while... <STRONG>Now, the good news! I've been asking Madonna and her beloved manager Caresse Henry during the last weeks to do a little something extra for the fans who haven't had a chance to see the show yet. Believe me, I've fought like crazy but finally got them to make it happen! So Madonna has decided to give her biggest fans a chance to celebrate the last show with her in Lisbon, Sept 14. These are not promoter seats - these are seats reserved for the most special people in Madonna's life, her friends and her family. Please note that just a few tix are available and that the word here is first come, first serve.</STRONG> <BR><BR>If you want to order yours, please e-mail me at <A href="mailto:icontest@moov-u.com">icontest@moov-u.com</A> before Sept 14, 9:00AM, Western European Time and I will take care of your request. Don't forget that I don't have tons of tix available, just a few, so e-mail me as soon as possible. Ticket prices range from $133.82 and $192.65. Special note: If you're an Icon member, please specify your full info and member ID in your message. You can order tix even if you're not a member of <STRONG>Madonna's official fanclub</STRONG> but keep in mind that requests coming from existing members will be treated in priority. <BR><BR>If you place a request you will receive an order form. Please specify on the order form if you would like level 2 and level 3 tickets if there are no more level 1 tickets available. You will receive an email confirming your order by 2:00PM Western European Time. Also, if you have not received an order form by 9:00AM, it means that tickets are not available for your request. <BR><BR>Please direct any questions to: <A href="mailto:icontest@moov-u.com">icontest@moov-u.com</A> <BR><BR><BR><STRONG>Good luck to you all! <BR>xoxox <BR>Johann - Icon</STRONG>
</font></div>
	</td>
  </tr>
