    <td background="images/bg.gif"><font class=""><a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=36">Press Collection</a></font><br><font class="testo_notizia" color="#000000"><b>MADONNA in A J T - August-September 2004.</b></font></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="1">
    <td  background="images/riga.gif"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtcover.jpg"><IMG height=178 src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtcover.jpg" width=500 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtlogo.jpg" border=0></P>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtuno.jpg"><IMG height=385 src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtuno.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><STRONG>on selling the Maverick to Warner..</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajttre.jpg" border=0></P>
<P align=center><STRONG>the unofficial 2005 calendar</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtquattro.jpg"><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtquattro.jpg" width=400 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><STRONG><FONT color=#0000ff>Sharon OSBOURNE vs MADONNA</FONT></STRONG></P>
<P align=center><FONT color=#0000ff size=2><STRONG>Sharon:</STRONG></FONT></P>
<P align=center>"You know what, I believe i was&nbsp; fainting when i saw&nbsp;Madonna new head, with all this Botox in her face. Oh, Madonna, I know what you did ! There is not a wrinkle on that face ! " </P>
<P align=center><STRONG>Madonna:</STRONG></P>
<P align=center>" She always says this kind of things.I've always been accused of doing things wich i didn't !&nbsp; I did not&nbsp;have plastic surgery nor&nbsp; Botox. I am happy&nbsp;with my&nbsp;life and this is it !</P>
<P align=center><STRONG><FONT color=#0000ff></FONT></STRONG>&nbsp;</P>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtcinque.jpg"><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtcinque.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<DIV>"<STRONG>I am in the right&nbsp;place today</STRONG>. I realized that I&nbsp;didn't&nbsp;anything in my life until now. I know that I burned the life by the two ends for a long time, but that does not mean anything for me today. I only start to appreciate the most important things of the life such as the intimacy, the love and maternity. The&nbsp; exhibitionnism and all that surrounds it, are nothing. They are only demonstrations of loneliness,&nbsp;despair, and in best of the cases,&nbsp;curiosity. <STRONG>When you have all&nbsp;that you&nbsp; have dreamt of, the money, the celebrity, the glory, and&nbsp; you realize that you are still unhappy, you think that it is&nbsp;the right moment&nbsp; to go and search the true happiness ! " </STRONG></DIV>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtsei.jpg"><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtsei.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtsette.jpg"><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtsette.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtotto.jpg"><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtotto.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtnove.jpg"><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtnove.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center>&nbsp;</P>
<P align=center><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtdieci.jpg"><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ajtdieci.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center>&nbsp;</P>
<P align=center><STRONG>[click to enlarge]</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><STRONG>special thanks to our French correspondent "sweet" Claudine</STRONG></P>
</font></div>
